"usage: firefly-reports demo [-h] [--url URL] [--token TOKEN] [--lang {en,it}] [--debug] [--debug-file PATH] [--out DIR] [--year YYYY] Generate every report from built-in sample data (no Firefly III needed). options: -h, --help show this help message and exit --url URL Firefly III base URL --token TOKEN Personal Access Token --lang {en,it} Language of the output --debug Enable debug log to file --debug-file PATH Log file path --out DIR Output directory --year YYYY Year (default: 2025)"
